    "report.connectionChecklist": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Used in FinderDiagnosticsReport. Arguments: 1 (String), 2 (String), 3 (String), 4 (String), 5 (String), 6 (String), 7 (String), 8 (String), 9 (String), 10 (String), 11 (String), 12 (String), 13 (String), 14 (String), 15 (String), 16 (String), 17 (String), 18 (String), 19 (String), 20 (String), 21 (String), 22 (String), 23 (String), 24 (String), 25 (String).",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connection checks:\n1. Menu generation: look for finder menu requested / finder menu built\n2. Click event: look for finder sync action selected / extension secure enqueue start\n3. Dispatch: look for extension secure command sent awaiting reply\n4. Agent receipt: look for agent received secure finder command\n5. Acknowledgment: look for extension secure command accepted; a timeout means Runtime Host did not respond\n6. Result: look for processor resolved target / processor handle success or failed\n\nRegistering a directory does not guarantee menu callbacks. For iCloud and other cloud drives, use Arc Kit in the Finder toolbar.\n\nSnapshot version: %1$@\nDirectory URLs: %2$@\nSnapshot: %3$@\nRuntime Host: %4$@\nHealth snapshot: %5$@ (%6$@)\nIn-memory snapshot: %7$@\nExtension files: %8$@\nUser enabled: %9$@\nLive extension response: %10$@\nPlugInKit registration: %11$@\nPlugInKit path: %12$@\nPlugInKit uniqueness: %13$@\nAgent files: %14$@\nAgent status: %15$@\nAgent path: %16$@\nAgent uniqueness: %17$@\nBackground lifecycle: unified Runtime Host; starts on demand and exits when idle for Finder-only use\nLaunchAgent plist: %18$@\nBackground permission: %19$@\nAccessibility permission: %20$@\nShared storage: %21$@\nTarget source: only the current Finder menu callback. Missing targets stop the operation; other windows are never inferred through automation.\n\nPlugInKit:\n%22$@\n\nLaunchAgent:\n%23$@\n\nAgent processes:\n%24$@\n\nRecent logs:\n%25$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "链路检查：\n1. 菜单生成：查看日志中的 finder menu requested / finder menu built\n2. 点击事件：查看 finder sync action selected / extension secure enqueue start\n3. 命令投递：查看 extension secure command sent awaiting reply\n4. Agent 接收：查看 agent received secure finder command\n5. 扩展回执：查看 extension secure command accepted；超时则为 Runtime Host 未响应\n6. 执行结果：查看 processor resolved target / processor handle success 或 failed\n\n观察根已注册不代表该位置会收到菜单回调。iCloud 等云盘请使用 Finder 工具栏的 Arc Kit 菜单。\n\nSnapshot version: %1$@\nDirectory URLs: %2$@\nSnapshot: %3$@\nRuntime Host: %4$@\n健康快照：%5$@（%6$@）\n内存快照状态：%7$@\n扩展文件：%8$@\n用户启用：%9$@\n扩展实时回执：%10$@\nPlugInKit 注册：%11$@\nPlugInKit 路径：%12$@\nPlugInKit 唯一性：%13$@\nAgent 文件：%14$@\nAgent 状态：%15$@\nAgent 路径：%16$@\nAgent 唯一性：%17$@\n后台生命周期：统一 Runtime Host；仅 Finder 时按需启动、空闲退出\nLaunchAgent plist：%18$@\n后台系统许可：%19$@\n辅助功能权限：%20$@\n共享存储：%21$@\n目标来源：只使用本次 Finder 菜单回调；缺失时不操作文件，也不通过自动化猜测其他窗口。\n\nPlugInKit:\n%22$@\n\nLaunchAgent:\n%23$@\n\nAgent 进程:\n%24$@\n\n最近日志:\n%25$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
